# The cellular/IMS probe scene. One job only: keep the system out of idle
# sleep for the whole run. Without a hold the display locks a few minutes
# after boot, idle sleep suspends every scene process, the touch and the
# loader's USB endpoint go with it, and the phone sits frozen and warm
# (run 124850, 12:54:48 was the last console line; xl then declared the
# kernel hung and the phone was force-restarted). sleep_hold holds
# kPMMinutesToSleep and kPMMinutesToDim (userland/src/sleep_hold.c); 650 s
# outlives the run's XL_SECS=600 with margin.
/redwood/bin/sleep_hold 650 &
